00:45:38,140 --> 00:45:43,680
The framework models this as excessive accommodation combined with a catastrophic failure of isolation.

705
00:45:44,180 --> 00:45:52,760
The brain still has the capacity to build spikes for random noisy events, a stranger glancing at you in a coffee shop, a specific car driving past your house twice.

