00:46:08,540 --> 00:46:10,480
That is exactly the geometric failure.

711
00:46:10,980 --> 00:46:14,820
Local noise propagates globally into the smooth manifold.

712
00:46:14,820 --> 00:46:20,820
A random coincidence in the environment structurally distorts the patient's entire worldview.

713
00:46:21,360 --> 00:46:23,320
So the stranger isn't just a stranger anymore.

714
00:46:23,480 --> 00:46:23,620
Right.

