00:46:29,920 --> 00:46:36,280
The geometry fails to isolate the noise, meaning every random event is given profound, global significance.

718
00:46:36,840 --> 00:46:42,580
It is a terrifying state where the world feels completely saturated with hidden, connected meaning.

719
00:46:42,580 --> 00:46:45,700
That is chilling, but also incredibly clarifying.

