00:47:55,860 --> 00:48:02,960
Because this exact architecture, a massive, undifferentiated space trying to organize itself, is exactly what we are currently building in the tech world.

735
00:48:03,400 --> 00:48:07,580
Let's look at what this means for artificial intelligence, what the paper calls the labyrinth problem.

