00:48:59,280 --> 00:49:02,440
The experiential density of the internet is practically infinite.

748
00:49:02,780 --> 00:49:07,900
So relative to the sheer size of the internet, a trillion parameter LLM might actually be constrained.

749
00:49:08,320 --> 00:49:08,780
Exactly.

