00:49:09,140 --> 00:49:13,320
This is one of the most profound insights of applying this framework to AI.

751
00:49:13,320 --> 00:49:23,540
Despite their massive size, many current LLMs are likely operating in a constrained or near-threshold regime relative to the staggering complexity of human culture.

752
00:49:23,780 --> 00:49:26,660
And this beautifully, perfectly explains their behavior.

753
00:49:26,920 --> 00:49:27,340
