00:50:23,260 --> 00:50:37,780
It's just that the AI compressed the concept of historical figure and the concept of famous battle into the same general smooth region of its geometry, and it didn't have the excess off-ramps to keep those two concepts strictly separated.

769
00:50:38,120 --> 00:50:38,700
Precisely.

