00:53:06,060 --> 00:53:07,960
It brings up something called the labyrinth problem.

814
00:53:08,100 --> 00:53:08,620
What is that?

815
00:53:08,620 --> 00:53:12,100
The labyrinth problem is the dark side of infinite abundance.

816
00:53:12,960 --> 00:53:23,820
As you aggressively increase the dimensionality of a representational space, as you add thousands and millions more lanes to the highway, the space becomes exponentially harder to navigate.

817
00:53:24,020 --> 00:53:25,480
Because there are just too many options.

818
00:53:25,740 --> 00:53:25,960
Yes.

