00:53:26,360 --> 00:53:29,080
The geometry becomes overwhelmingly vast.

820
00:53:29,080 --> 00:53:36,500
The model has so much structural freedom that the number of possible paths through the manifold becomes practically infinite.

821
00:53:36,500 --> 00:53:52,960
Without strong global priors or structural constraints forcing the model in a certain direction, an infinitely large AI might perfectly memorize every single piece of data in existence, but become computationally paralyzed trying to retrieve or infer anything useful.

